cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Computational verification for k-independence in P4-tidy graphs"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Cappelle"
    given-names: "Márcia R."
  - family-names: "Carvalho"
    given-names: "Luan Cesar D."
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-20
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Computational verification code for the formulas for the k-independence
  number of spiders and quasi-spiders used in the manuscript
  "k-independence in P4-tidy graphs". The verification considers m in
  {2,3,4}, every labelled simple graph on a head R with at most four
  vertices, the two spider types, the eight quasi-spider types, and all
  relevant values of k.
keywords:
  - graph theory
  - k-independence
  - P4-tidy graphs
  - spiders
  - quasi-spiders
  - computational verification
